# Normalize line endings on the way in, so a script that reads a checked-out file and writes
# it back cannot commit a third line ending on top of the two it started with. See item 107
# in the backlog and docs/DECISIONS.md's packaging section.
#
# The repo already stores LF (core.autocrlf on Windows checkouts converts on the way out),
# so eol=lf matches what is already committed - this does not rewrite history, it stops
# relying on every contributor's local git config to keep doing the conversion correctly.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.svg -text
